---
import { routeEnglish } from "@ts-config-path/lib/menu";
import { LINKS_TO } from "@styles/utilsCSS";
---

<section class="mb-8 break-normal hyphens-auto">
  <p class="mb-4">
    I build creative systems to explore math, computation, and music through
    structural analogies. Over time, I've noticed that formal systems are at the
    core of my interests.
  </p>

  <p class="mb-4">
    My libraries include{" "}
    <a
      href="https://rubygems.org/gems/modular_forms"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener"
      class={LINKS_TO}
    >
      modular forms
    </a>{" "}
    (SageMath/LMFDB-inspired),{" "}
    <a
      id="projects"
      href={routeEnglish.projects}
      rel="noopener"
      class={LINKS_TO}
    >
      multidimensional figurate numbers
    </a>{" "}
    with over <strong>26,000 downloads</strong>, and{" "}
    <a
      href="https://topos.live/#ziffers_tonnetz"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener"
      class={LINKS_TO}
    >
      ts-tonnetz
    </a>.
  </p>

  <p class="mb-4">
    I have published a
    {" "}
    <a
      href="https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-031-07015-0_30"
      target="_blank"
      class={LINKS_TO}
      rel="noopener"
    >
      Scopus-indexed article
    </a>
    {" "}
    on Mathematical Music Theory, serve as a {" "}<a
      id="cy-effective-orcid-url"
      class={LINKS_TO}
      href="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9672-9087"
      target="orcid.widget"
      rel="me noopener noreferrer"
      style="vertical-align: top"
    >
      peer reviewer
    </a>{" "} for <em>The European Physical Journal Special Topics</em>,
    contribute to international open-source projects, and teach postgraduate
    courses.
  </p>
</section>
